WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:05.760
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, my Season 4
countdown continues.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.810
Also if you hadn’t noticed, I just changed
my youtube avatar.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.970
It’s just meant to look a little bit more
like my face.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:14.430
This time I’ll be talking about my Top 10
characters on the show.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.790
Especially given where things are headed in
season 4.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.980
My biggest favorites always get shuffled a
little based on what happens each season,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.790
so people that were my favorite in season
1 might be lower on the list right now.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.290
All that being said, as I work my way down
the list to my own number one.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.920
Here’s the biggest question we need to answer.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.150
Who is the most important character in A Song
of Ice and Fire?

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:39.120
Not the coolest or most powerful, the most
important.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.640
Like if you were forced to say who the one
main character is after everything is done.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.640
This would be that person.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.760
So as you think about that, also think about
this.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.290
Is the most important character the person
that ends up on the Iron Throne, or is it

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.290
the person that put them there.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.290
So real quick before we try to answer that
question.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:53.280
I’m going to do one more countdown video
tomorrow morning and then my next video will

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.170
be my review of Episode 1.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.829
If you’re finding me for the first time
I’m doing a weekly giveaway.

00:00:57.829 --> 00:00:59.559
The winner is picked at random from the comments.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:04.379
All you have to do is be a subscriber and
leave a comment on my review video each week.

00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:05.930
I’ll explain more tomorrow.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.049
Now, let’s get started.

00:01:08.049 --> 00:01:09.049
Dragons are coming.

00:01:09.049 --> 00:01:10.049
And Winter.

00:01:10.049 --> 00:01:11.189
Here’s my Top 10 Characters going into Season
4.

00:01:11.189 --> 00:01:17.479
Careful for potential spoilers if you’re
not caught up on Season 3.

00:01:17.479 --> 00:01:18.479
Number 10 - Daario.

00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:22.459
I guess you could say the new Daario since
we’re also talking about actors.

00:01:22.459 --> 00:01:26.890
He mostly makes the list because the character
is such a big part of Daenerys story and she’s

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:27.890
also on this list.

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:32.249
I feel like the people who are most important
to the most important people are sometimes

00:01:32.249 --> 00:01:34.650
also the most interesting characters.

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:39.549
Daario as we’ve seen him so far is essentially
the special forces leader of Daenerys Army.

00:01:39.549 --> 00:01:44.130
Yes Grey Worm is technically the leader of
the Army, but Daario is the person she calls

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:48.169
on for the most important political missions
and doing covert dirty work.

00:01:48.169 --> 00:01:52.889
The swagger the character has is also a lot
of fun given how proper the rest of Dany’s

00:01:52.889 --> 00:01:54.119
inner circle is.

00:01:54.119 --> 00:01:58.170
You have two knights who are almost Yes Men
and a few influential women.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:02.729
Daario is one of the few people that kind
of just does what Daario wants to do.

00:02:02.729 --> 00:02:07.509
Adding Sex into the equation makes his relationship
with Dany and the dynamic between him and

00:02:07.509 --> 00:02:12.590
her other male advisors a little funny too.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.920
I’m hoping that since they went through
through the trouble to recast the role, they

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.590
added a lot more of his book scenes.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:23.250
We’ve already seen a clip of him and it’s
very promising.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:24.610
Number 9 - Sansa Stark.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:29.860
Someone who you might write off because of
how much shit she’s taken from the Lannisters,

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:32.700
but I think she’s going to surprise us.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.110
We also have to acknowledge how much Sophie
Turner has matured as an actress since the

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.140
show has started.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:41.120
I feel like they keep giving Sansa more to
do each season because Sophie Turner has become

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.750
so much more compelling as things get worse
for her character.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:51.920
I will say that I love tv show Sansa a lot
more than book Sansa, and that’s all because

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.260
of Sophie.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:58.370
One of my other favorite things about her
is that because she’s quote unquote a flower,

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:01.340
other characters tend to overlook her.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:07.320
So she gets to be present for some of the
biggest and best scenes just because no one

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.410
is really paying attention to her.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.410
With the exception of Joffrey.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.180
I’m most looking forward to seeing how Sophie
Turner interprets Sansa as all these new Season

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:15.180
4 mega events unfold.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:16.930
And the really cool thing for all the book
readers out there is that she’s a POV character

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:17.930
in Winds of Winter.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:18.930
They haven’t posted any excerpts for her
yet though.

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:19.930
Number 8 - Melisandre.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:20.930
The Lady in Red.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.490
Even though Daenerys brought dragons back
into the world, Melisandre is the most visible

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:24.720
symbol of magic on the show.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:29.490
She’s add this whole sex aspect to it that
really makes you afraid and turned on at the

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:30.650
same time.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:33.420
Like imagine how Gendry felt with the sex
leeches.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.660
Disgusting, terrifying and awesome at the
same time.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:42.310
She’s also one of the wisest characters
on the show next to Tyrion and Varys.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.970
She really is like a female Maester who’s
not a Maester.

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:48.490
They really teased the Wall during that last
scene at Dragonstone in Season 3.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:55.880
So what I’m most looking forward to from
her is seeing how she interacts with Jon Snow.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.800
And watching him react to her will also be
so much fun.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.870
He has a very spotty track record with sexy
gingers.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:06.200
Number 7 - Oberyn Martell, the Red Viper of
Dorne.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:09.490
For a lot of people who haven’t read the
books he’s a totally new character.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.770
Which is one of the reasons I like him so
much.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.920
He’s fresh meat for the King’s Landing
grinder.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.440
He also brings Dorne into the story in a much
bigger way.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.759
It’s a whole region of Westeros we haven’t
seen yet.

00:04:20.759 --> 00:04:24.819
One of the coolest things about big epic stories
like Ice and Fire is that they’re literally

00:04:24.819 --> 00:04:25.819
big places.

00:04:25.819 --> 00:04:30.249
So you don’t just get stuck with the same
group of characters for 7 or 8 seasons.

00:04:30.249 --> 00:04:32.289
Of all the new characters coming in the near
future.

00:04:32.289 --> 00:04:33.879
He’s one of the best.

00:04:33.879 --> 00:04:38.479
I really hope we see more Dorne in season
5, but this year I’m most looking forward

00:04:38.479 --> 00:04:39.479
to watching him fight.

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:43.289
That’s essentially what his reputation is,
being one of the best fighters in Westeros.

00:04:43.289 --> 00:04:48.010
And because of the different culture, he fights
in this really cool way none of the other

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.419
knights of King’s Landing do.

00:04:49.419 --> 00:04:52.729
We actually got some teasers for this in all
the trailers they’ve been posting.

00:04:52.729 --> 00:04:54.610
Number 6 - Brienne of Tarth.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.199
Probably the only real knight in Westeros.

00:04:57.199 --> 00:05:02.039
Brienne was so awesome in season 3 and watching
Gwendoline Christie with Nikolaj Coster-Waldau

00:05:02.039 --> 00:05:03.830
was one of my favorite things.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.349
I could watch a whole season of just the two
of them together.

00:05:06.349 --> 00:05:08.599
World’s best odd couple.

00:05:08.599 --> 00:05:12.009
Brienne is probably the most noble person
in Westeros.

00:05:12.009 --> 00:05:16.259
Even in the first episode you got the sense
that just because people were knights, didn’t

00:05:16.259 --> 00:05:17.740
mean they were honorable.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.189
Playing the Game of Thrones and all.

00:05:19.189 --> 00:05:23.229
But Brienne is one of the only characters
that doesn’t care about any of that.

00:05:23.229 --> 00:05:27.539
She has this beautiful dream of knighthood
and it’s works so well when you juxtapose

00:05:27.539 --> 00:05:32.560
it with someone like Jaime Lannister, who
essentially doesn’t care about anything.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:37.309
I think he thinks he cares about Cersei, but
he has doubts about even that.

00:05:37.309 --> 00:05:40.969
So it’s like Pure belief and Nhilism walking
around together.

00:05:40.969 --> 00:05:45.960
The think I’m most looking forward to for
her in season 4 is seeing her adapt to the

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:49.199
rewards and challenges of King’s Landing.

00:05:49.199 --> 00:05:52.809
She largely gets credit for bringing Jaime
back and as much as she rubbed of on him.

00:05:52.809 --> 00:05:56.430
I can’t wait to see him try to repay her.

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:57.900
Number 5 - Arya Stark.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:00.069
Stabby Death Machine in training.

00:06:00.069 --> 00:06:03.099
All of the clips of Arya that we’ve seen
from the trailers have been action scenes

00:06:03.099 --> 00:06:06.120
and her in the middle of a warrior training
montage with Needle.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:10.569
I just love how dark she is, it’s this whole
level of complexity that Sansa hasn’t quite

00:06:10.569 --> 00:06:14.559
got to and something that goes way beyond
where Jon Snow or Bran are.

00:06:14.559 --> 00:06:16.919
Despite all those characters have been through.

00:06:16.919 --> 00:06:21.660
She’s one of the few characters on the show
that embraces the direction she’s headed.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.189
Revenge Machine.

00:06:23.189 --> 00:06:26.909
How appropriate that we saw the Titan of Braavos
in one of the trailers.

00:06:26.909 --> 00:06:32.589
Kind of heralding the return of faceless ones.

00:06:32.589 --> 00:06:35.870
You also can’t talk about her right now
without talking about the houd.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.690
Of all the twosomes on the show.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:41.749
She and the Hound are my second favorite behind
Jaime and Brienne.

00:06:41.749 --> 00:06:46.169
It says a lot about who the strongest characters
are when you see who rubs off on who.

00:06:46.169 --> 00:06:49.789
For instance, Brienne is a much stronger character
than Jaime right now.

00:06:49.789 --> 00:06:51.319
So she rubs off on him.

00:06:51.319 --> 00:06:54.339
And Arya is a much stronger character than
the hound.

00:06:54.339 --> 00:06:56.029
In an intense dark way.

00:06:56.029 --> 00:06:57.620
So she rubs off on him.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:02.650
It’s just so funny and awesome to think
that such a young small character has a stronger

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.909
presence than someone as vicious as The Hound.

00:07:05.909 --> 00:07:07.289
Number 4 - Jon Snow.

00:07:07.289 --> 00:07:12.939
He’s a real fan favorite because Kit Harington
is so awesome and because the character has

00:07:12.939 --> 00:07:13.939
so much potential.

00:07:13.939 --> 00:07:18.069
There’s a lot of things in the story that
make you feel like he’s destined for greatness.

00:07:18.069 --> 00:07:22.029
So he’s in my Top 5 mostly because I feel
like he’s going to be one of the focal points

00:07:22.029 --> 00:07:25.240
of the story as things move into Winds of
Winter.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:29.509
One of the biggest problems of Season 3 was
that he was off on his own with the Wildlings.

00:07:29.509 --> 00:07:32.940
Yes, it was so much fun watching him react
to Ygritte.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.440
Guess which one of them had the stronger personality.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.839
But he didn’t really get to interact with
any of the other characters.

00:07:37.839 --> 00:07:41.499
I liked Ciaran Hinds as Mance Rayder, but
he was barely there.

00:07:41.499 --> 00:07:46.380
And a lot of the Wildlings with the exception
of Ygritte and the Lord of Bones were forgettable.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.729
Giants notwithstanding.

00:07:48.729 --> 00:07:52.919
The thing I’m most looking forward to from
him in season 4 is taking more of a leadership

00:07:52.919 --> 00:07:53.919
role.

00:07:53.919 --> 00:07:55.050
It’s time to grow up boy.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.100
We’ve already seen him with Sam in the Night’s
Watch library.

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:04.630
So I can’t wait to see them deal with the
Wildling army, angry ex girlfriends and hopefully

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.469
some more white walkers.

00:08:06.469 --> 00:08:08.069
Number 3 - Tyrion Lannister

00:08:08.069 --> 00:08:12.069
I really do feel like once we get through
Season 4 he’ll be one of the most important

00:08:12.069 --> 00:08:14.999
characters, but this year it looks like he’s
going to be hanging out in the black cells.

00:08:14.999 --> 00:08:17.199
And he can’t start having a greater impact
until he gets out.

00:08:17.199 --> 00:08:22.430
Tyrion is one of the most interesting characters
on the show just in general for two big reasons.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:27.039
One George RR Martin has said that he identifies
with him the most, so I feel like he expresses

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:29.099
the character in a much deeper way.

00:08:29.099 --> 00:08:32.349
And two, Peter Dinklage is one of the best
actors on the show.

00:08:32.349 --> 00:08:36.850
There was this really cool thing that Dinklage
said about acting in an sword and sandal show

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:37.850
like Game of Thrones.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:42.400
He said that because it’s such a grand setting,
actors tend to overdo their performance a

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.400
lot.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.490
Like cranking the acting knob to 11.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:50.430
But he has this subtle way of delivering lines
or saying things using gestures that just

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:53.780
comes across so much more effectively than
yelling your lines ever could.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:58.250
That’s why I feel like HBO kind of makes
him one of the centerpieces of the show, from

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.840
a marketing stand point.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.240
Next to Emilia Clarke.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:06.280
The thing I’m most looking forward to from
Tyrion in Season 4 is repaying all his debts.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:09.120
Because a Lannister always repays his debts.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.530
Sometimes with revenge.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:11.830
Number 2 - Jaime Lannister.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:16.500
There has been so much Jaime in all the trailers
that I feel like he more than anyone with

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.230
the exception of Tyrion will be the biggest
character in King’s Landing.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:24.550
Yes Purple Wedding, but think about the entire
season.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:28.200
As of the end of Season 3, he’s undergone
one of the biggest character transformations

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.380
next to Theon.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:33.310
There’s so much of Brienne’s nobility
in him now I can’t wait to see how he deals

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.640
with all the shit going down in King’s Landing.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.740
The Golden hand is just the icing on the cake.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.960
It’s just a visual sign of his transformation.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:44.480
There’s oathkeeper and the White Cloaks.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.480
Mark my words.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.250
By the end of Season 4, Jaime will be one
of your favorite characters if he’s not

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.250
already.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:56.390
I’m most interested to see how he deals
with all the changes happening in King’s

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.390
Landing.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.340
Like Cersei, who’s kind of changing herself.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.630
He’s going to be leading the White Cloaks
too.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:04.960
I don’t think he’s going to become another
Barristan Selmy, but I do think he’s trying

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:08.620
to be the kind of person Brienne would respect
and admire.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.920
Plus there’s him learning to fight with
his left hand.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.100
I can’t wait to see him train with Bronn.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.570
They changed that from the books for anyone
who’s wondering.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:18.410
Number 1 - Daenerys

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:23.780
Just talking about Season 4, I feel like she’s
going to be the biggest and most important.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:27.320
Joffrey is King of Westeros, but he’s really
just a figurehead.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:31.440
Daenerys is earning her kingdom, one freed
slave at a time.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.800
Then there’s the dragons.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:39.330
Of all the things HBO pumped up in the trailers
it was the size of the dragons now.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:43.170
Even on the Black Friday South Park episode
it was all about ‘dragons are coming’.

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:46.960
They’re collectively always going to be
at least the second most important characters

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.600
in A Song of Ice And Fire no matter what happens.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:49.600
It will be like Dany is the biggest, the Tyrion
or Jon Snow.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.600
And always right behind them Dragons.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.600
If you wanted to get someone excited about
the show who hadn’t seen it all you would

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.600
have to say would be “Dragons are coming.”

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:53.600
And they would totally get it.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.360
The thing I’m most looking forward to from
Daenerys in Season 4 is her trying to be a

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.840
real queen.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.250
Not just a General like she was in season
3.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:03.510
That story arc was all about conquering, but
now she actually has to learn to rule.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:07.480
Think of it as a like a practice run for the
Iron Throne.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:13.290
Emilia Clarke has done such an amazing job
of portraying someone who is essentially a

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:17.590
little girl learning to be a general, then
the mother of dragons and now a queen on top

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:18.590
of all that.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.650
Remember Dany isn’t a lot older than Arya.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:27.870
But now it’s your turn, let me know who
your favorite character is right now and who

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.210
your favorite actor is.

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:32.240
It doesn’t have to be the same person.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:38.870
Tomorrow morning I’ll post my Top 10 Moments
from Season 3 and then my episode 1 review

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:39.870
that night.

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:43.290
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
participate in the giveaway.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:48.380
Right now click here for all the rest of my
countdown videos and click here to watch all

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:51.430
my trailer breakdowns.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.430
Dragons are coming.

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.430
Tomorrow.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.430
High Fives everyone.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:54.434
The wait is over.

